[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 22267.628, "timestamp": "06:11:07", "text": "但我會挺過去的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22270.31, "timestamp": "06:11:10", "text": "。所有人等等。 所以別擔心。我先走了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22286.07, "timestamp": "06:11:26", "text": "嘿，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22291.83, "timestamp": "06:11:31", "text": "[音樂][音樂] V 在哪裡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22294.948, "timestamp": "06:11:34", "text": "？ Chama。 Expos”，就像去年一樣。大概是六"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22299.07, "timestamp": "06:11:39", "text": "七個月前了。我們很久沒一起玩了。同樣的事情。這次"}]